flowchart LR
  subgraph Clients[Product surfaces]
    Member[Weave Client\nmember features only]
    Admin[Organization/Admin Console\nprovider choice, policy, readiness]
  end

  subgraph Backend[Weave backend]
    FeatureAPI[Canonical feature APIs\nchat, files/docs, calendar/meetings, boards/tasks, identity]
    ControlPlane[Admin/control-plane APIs\nProviderConfig, CapabilityPolicy, Whitelist, SecretRef, Readiness]
    Policy[Deny-by-default policy engine\nRBAC + capability whitelists]
    Registry[Adapter registry\ncapability -> provider adapter]
    Mapper[Mapping layer\nWeave IDs <-> provider IDs\nlossy mapping notes]
    Audit[Support-safe audit log]
  end

  subgraph Providers[Provider adapters]
    SelfHosted[Recommended self-hosted defaults\nKeycloak, Matrix, Nextcloud, OpenProject, LiveKit]
    External[External / managed providers\nEntra, Teams, Slack, SharePoint, Planner, Jira]
  end

  Member -->|stable Weave models only| FeatureAPI
  Admin -->|provider configs and policy| ControlPlane
  FeatureAPI --> Policy
  ControlPlane --> Policy
  ControlPlane --> Registry
  FeatureAPI --> Registry
  Registry --> Mapper
  Mapper --> SelfHosted
  Mapper --> External
  Policy --> Audit
  Registry --> Audit
  Mapper --> Audit

  Member -. never .-> SelfHosted
  Member -. never .-> External
  Admin -. no raw secrets to member .-> Member
